      "content": "thanks. that makes sense. one thing though—the lead times from my suppliers in shenzhen have been super inconsistent lately. sometimes it's 14 days, sometimes it's 30. how should i adjust the formula or my logic if the lead time itself is the unpredictable part? like, how do i account for those sudden delays?",
